sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor A as Petugas
participant UI as Halaman Login
participant AUTH as AuthController
participant DB as Basis Data
A->>UI: Mengisi email dan kata sandi
UI->>AUTH: Mengirim kredensial
AUTH->>DB: Mencari akun aktif
DB->>AUTH: Mengembalikan akun
AUTH->>AUTH: Memverifikasi kata sandi
AUTH-->>UI: Membentuk sesi
UI-->>A: Menampilkan dashboard